{"screen_name": "imaginally", "file": "imaginally", "name": "渡部アクサ🐱🕯🐔", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1587782190632677376/A1jydRU_.png", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/94275625/1610155984/1500x500", "description": "♨おなまえ：渡部アクサ（わたべ−）|フォロバ不要|絵とかUTAU声とかV一般人とか|有言不実行|無職障害者メンヘラクズ/FRBお好きに|鍵＠wataxa2219 音源 #madoiboshi_info http://skeb.jp/@imaginally", "total_works": 20, "scraped_works": 20, "first_seen": "2026-03-20T12:06:05.670594+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-03-20T12:06:05.670594+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 3000, "recorded_at": "2026-03-20T12:06:05.670594+00:00"}], "correction": [{"amount": 500, "recorded_at": "2026-03-20T12:06:05.670594+00:00"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 3000, "correction": 500}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 3000, "max": 3000}, "correction": {"min": 500, "max": 500}}, "links": [{"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/imaginally", "name": "imaginally"}, {"label": "Bluesky", "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/imaginally.bsky.social", "name": "imaginally.bsky.social"}, {"label": "Website", "url": "https://potofu.me/wataxa", "name": ""}], "flags": {}, "acceptable": true, "works": [{"path": "/@imaginally/works/21", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/371b7416/uploads/origins/65616a4c-277f-4b15-b7ed-e10186be2f5e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=47b3545df651a3d0e9a0f6c0088764bd", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/371b7416/uploads/origins/65616a4c-277f-4b15-b7ed-e10186be2f5e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=47b3545df651a3d0e9a0f6c0088764bd, https://si.imgix.net/371b7416/uploads/origins/65616a4c-277f-4b15-b7ed-e10186be2f5e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f1a914cb5c887780e05b90055f3c3a41 2x, https://si.imgix.net/371b7416/uploads/origins/65616a4c-277f-4b15-b7ed-e10186be2f5e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=55614b1f03eb0